WEBVTT

A1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.400 line:76%
Guide: Select Security in Settings.

B1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:76%
User: Can I discard the old code now?

A2
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.600 line:76%
Guide: No. Do not discard it before saving the new recovery code.

SFX
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.820 line:76%
[Two warning beeps signaling security check failure]

A3
00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:19.460 line:76%
Guide: After repeating the security check, confirm issuance.

A4
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:26.700 line:76%
Guide: Save the new code in a safe place. Once a new code is issued, the old code can no longer be used.

A5
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.580 line:76%
Guide: Check the issuance complete screen.
